l features of long-lived plasma cells and migrated to the bone marrow in immunodeficient mice. After transferring human plasma cells to immunodeficient mice in the presence of the human cytokines BAFF and IL6, we observed increases in retention of plasma cells in the bone marrow, with engraftment exceeding a year. The most profound in vivo effects of human IL6 were observed within 20 days of transfer and could be explained by decreased apoptosis in newly differentiated plasma cells. Collectively, these results show that ex vivo engineered and differentiated human plasma cells have the potential for long-lived in vivo protein secretion, which can be modeled in small animals.","topics":[],"score":224053,"global_rank":156303},{"name":"JeremyPVargas/portfolio_analyzer_tool","owner":"JeremyPVargas","html_url":"https://github.com/JeremyPVargas/portfolio_analyzer_tool","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"This tool models risk analysis of assets in a single DataFrame. The analysis includes risk-return metrics such as daily returns, standard deviation, Sharpe ratio and beta. Assets are evaluated using rolling statistics to track risk-reward behavior over time","topics":[],"score":224053,"global_rank":156305},{"name":"thomasgreenacre/DE_Wk1_Project-3--Part1--core-","owner":"thomasgreenacre","html_url":"https://github.com/thomasgreenacre/DE_Wk1_Project-3--Part1--core-","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":224053,"global_rank":156308},{"name":"thomasgreenacre/DE_Week1_GitHub-Desktop--Practice-","owner":"thomasgreenacre","html_url":"https://github.com/thomasgreenacre/DE_Week1_GitHub-Desktop--Practice-","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":224053,"global_rank":156309},{"name":"seabassR5/ml_from_scratch","owner":"seabassR5","html_url":"https://github.com/seabassR5/ml_from_scratch